Karl is the secondary Protagonist rival;
He doesn't like to battle with his Pokémon and shows lack of confidence but he's trying to change after being shown that Pokémon battles can also be a way of bonding.

He is the son of Prof. George who he really looks up to as a role model. His father offered him an offspring of his Metagross to help him start his journey with a strong Pokémon but not only until he met the Protagonist did he start using it.

His ways of thinking and acting suggest that he might be on the spectrum, but on a lighter level.

Born and raised in Hessia he will help both the Protagonist and Meryl navigating through the region and accompanying them while finishing his studies to follow his father's step foots.

Will Karl turn out to be a strong battler? Only time will tell!
